  "description": "Ban enforcement for SetNet: an inbound gate that drops all frames from a banned peer (by IP or a custom key such as account id) and instantly kicks matching live peers. Pluggable IBanStore (default in-process; supply Redis/DB for cross-node). server.UseBanList(). Composes with Auth/RateLimit. Depends only on SetNet.",
